#: bluefairy-consent.php
msgid "Cookie consent banner with Accept and Reject given equal weight, Google Consent Mode v2, Global Privacy Control, and Google Analytics 4 / Tag Manager loaded only after consent. Page-cache safe: the decision is made in the browser. No CDN, no account."
msgstr ""

