msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin.php:89
msgid "Turn off WooCommerce order attribution."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin.php:89
msgid "WooCommerce order attribution sets sbjs_* cookies on the first page view, before the visitor has chosen. Tick this to stop it for every visitor, including those who accept: no attribution script, no sbjs_* cookies, and new orders carry no Origin. Checkout is not affected. While this is ticked, WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Features shows Order Attribution as off. If you leave attribution on, add the sbjs_* cookies to the Cookie list."
msgstr ""

